         Solr ships a version that includes a fixed ZooKeeper release. The regex covers both the
         zookeeper and zookeeper-jute artifacts (same release train, same transitive origin). -->
    <suppress>
        <notes><![CDATA[
        file name: zookeeper-3.9.4.jar / zookeeper-jute-3.9.4.jar - transitive of solr-solrj-zookeeper, cannot be upgraded independently
        ]]></notes>
        <packageUrl regex="true">^pkg:maven/org\.apache\.zookeeper/zookeeper.*@.*$</packageUrl>
        <cve>CVE-2026-24308</cve>
        <cve>CVE-2026-24281</cve>
    </suppress>

